    {
      "text": "Heat the oven to 425°F (220°C). Mix the turkey, panko, egg, half the parmesan, the garlic, oregano, ¾ tsp salt and some pepper. Roll into 16 meatballs and set on an oiled sheet pan.",
      "uses": ["turkey", "panko", "egg", "parmesan", "garlic", "oregano", "salt", "pepper"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake until browned, about 15 minutes.",
