    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, cook the spaghetti in salted boiling water until al dente, about 10 minutes, then drain.",
      "uses": ["pasta"],
      "timerMinutes": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "Warm the marinara in a large skillet, add the meatballs and simmer for 5 minutes. Serve over the spaghetti with the rest of the parmesan and the basil.",
